    "created_at": "2021-03-15T22:52:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-15T22:52:20Z",
    "body": "Are there any issues with adding `media` to the `HTMLMetaElement`'s interface? As far as I can tell, it doesn't exist on the `<meta>` element as-is, and maybe there's no practical concern.\r\n\r\nAnother thing I'm curious about is the evaluation of other non-`prefers-color-scheme` media queries that may not be applicable to `<meta>` elements (e.g., `min-width`, `prefers-reduced-data`, etc), but that's probably a non-issue.\r\n\r\nIn principle, I'm all for this, and I think it'd be a great addition to the platform.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
