    "created_at": "2021-03-16T07:25:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-16T07:25:43Z",
    "body": "It seems fine to extend `meta` in the same way as `link`, where we add attributes for specific identifiers and other identifiers could adopt them as needed (but not have them from the get-go).\r\n\r\n(And speaking of web manifest, I think #6444 was a mistake as per https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/500 and web manifest should instead tackle media considerations on a per-feature basis, as this proposal does.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
